WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.240
1776, when we founded the light to all nations,

00:05.240 --> 00:08.300
and it's something really that is an amazing thing

00:08.300 --> 00:09.900
came out of that date.

00:09.900 --> 00:12.500
It's called the United States of America.

00:12.500 --> 00:14.540
In honor of this momentous anniversary,

00:14.540 --> 00:17.860
I hope that all countries who find inspiration in our example

00:17.860 --> 00:22.260
will join us in renewing our commitment, values,

00:22.260 --> 00:26.200
and those values, really, that we hold so dear together.

00:26.200 --> 00:28.800
Let us defend free speech and free expression.

00:28.800 --> 00:30.600
Let us protect religious liberty,

00:30.600 --> 00:35.440
including for the most persecuted religion on the planet today.

00:35.440 --> 00:37.740
It's called Christianity.

00:37.740 --> 00:41.100
And let us safeguard our sovereignty and cherish qualities

00:41.100 --> 00:44.200
that have made each of our nations so special,

00:44.200 --> 00:46.540
incredible, and extraordinary.

00:46.540 --> 00:49.260
In closing, I just want to repeat that immigration

00:49.260 --> 00:53.100
and the high cost of so-called green renewable energy

00:53.100 --> 00:55.860
is destroying a large part of the free world

00:55.860 --> 00:58.160
and a large part of our planet.

